      "comment": "THE MIGHTY BELL (7) is a lightly tried 6YO mare who made a winning debut fresh up from the local Brent Larsson stable here just over 5 weeks ago. She will only be sharper second up after a long spell, and with only an extra half a kilo  to carry, she can repeat the dose. MAGALI MAGIC (1) resumes from nearly a year off the scene, and has been tuned up with a quiet trial a couple of weeks ago. She is talented at best, so follow any market confidence. YAMASHITA'S GOLD (2) fought on bravely in a tougher field at Ascot just over 2 weeks ago, and has had a bunch of gear changes since then, if those adjustments help, then he is capable of figuring in the top 3. JUST GIFTED (5) has needed both of her starts back from a spell, fading in the run home after racing close to the pace. She will be peaking at the right time here, and can do better. Each way value. BONDITRAM (3) had an excuse last time out here nearly 4 weeks ago, and can make amends. Stick with him, especially from the pole.",
